<figure class="bb-verification-triangle" aria-label="Inferential harness, computational harness, and human review gates">
  <div class="bb-verification-triangle__viewport">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 920 430" role="img" aria-labelledby="bb-triangle-title bb-triangle-desc">
      <title id="bb-triangle-title">The Blackbox behavioral harness triangle</title>
      <desc id="bb-triangle-desc">Inferential Skills propose artifact changes, computational CLI commands validate and run system tests, and humans approve behavior changes before the harness changes.</desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id="bb-triangle-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto">
          <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#94a3b8"></path>
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <rect x="8" y="8" width="904" height="414" rx="18" fill="#111827" stroke="#374151"></rect>
      <text x="36" y="45" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="20" font-weight="800">Blackbox builds the behavior harness</text>
      <text x="36" y="72" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="13">Guides steer the change. Sensors observe the run. Humans approve behavior.</text>

      <rect x="330" y="100" width="260" height="92" rx="14" fill="#1f2937" stroke="#fbbf24"></rect>
      <text x="460" y="133" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fef3c7" font-size="16" font-weight="800">Human gates</text>
      <text x="460" y="158" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fde68a" font-size="13">approve accepted behavior</text>
      <text x="460" y="179" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fcd34d" font-size="11">requirements, Gherkin, suites, effects</text>

      <rect x="88" y="282" width="272" height="96" rx="14" fill="#172554" stroke="#60a5fa"></rect>
      <text x="224" y="316" text-anchor="middle" fill="#eff6ff" font-size="16" font-weight="800">Inferential harness</text>
      <text x="224" y="341" text-anchor="middle" fill="#bfdbfe" font-size="13">agent Skills propose artifacts</text>
      <text x="224" y="362" text-anchor="middle" fill="#93c5fd" font-size="11">EARS, Gherkin, effect policy</text>

      <rect x="560" y="282" width="272" height="96" rx="14" fill="#14532d" stroke="#86efac"></rect>
      <text x="696" y="316" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0fdf4" font-size="16" font-weight="800">Computational harness</text>
      <text x="696" y="341" text-anchor="middle" fill="#bbf7d0" font-size="13">CLI validates, aligns, runs</text>
      <text x="696" y="362" text-anchor="middle" fill="#86efac" font-size="11">suite AST, evidence, verdicts</text>

      <line x1="376" y1="204" x2="278" y2="270" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#bb-triangle-arrow)"></line>
      <text x="296" y="221" fill="#fde68a" font-size="12" font-weight="700">asks for proposals</text>

      <line x1="372" y1="330" x2="548" y2="330" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#bb-triangle-arrow)"></line>
      <text x="460" y="316" text-anchor="middle" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="12" font-weight="700">validate, run, report</text>

      <line x1="642" y1="270" x2="544" y2="204" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#bb-triangle-arrow)"></line>
      <text x="632" y="221" text-anchor="end" fill="#bbf7d0" font-size="12" font-weight="700">returns verdicts</text>

      <rect x="374" y="244" width="172" height="48" rx="12" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#c084fc"></rect>
      <text x="460" y="264" text-anchor="middle" fill="#faf5ff" font-size="12" font-weight="800">stable flow ID</text>
      <text x="460" y="281" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e9d5ff" font-size="11">the join key</text>

      <text x="460" y="405" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="12">No harness part owns truth alone. Blackbox verifies their explicit relationships.</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Blackbox keeps inference, computation, and human approval separate so a fast agent cannot silently move the behavior it is supposed to prove.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
